        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yeah, this is a fair concern. Right now I am trying to settle the directory ownership/override path (#40552, #40529). The intended model is that another plugin can own filetype=directory rather than fighting dir.lua after it has already claimed the buffer.\r\n\r\nOnce that lands, it should be clearer whether this mapping should remain as-is or not - I'm quite interested on speculating on a short-term fix if it may need to be entirely redone later. For example, I'm trying to *remove* `vim.g.loaded_nvim_dir_plugin`.\r\n\r\nSorry for the inconvenience, hoping to get these things done ASAP. Feel free to create a new issue out of this.",
